 production outputs."},"required_facts":["business_identity","service_goals","approved_claims","primary_contact"],"required_access":[]}'::jsonb)) seed(s);
insert into wm.catalog_registry(catalog_id,variant,catalog_version,snapshot,digest) select s->>'id',s->>'variant',s->>'catalog_version',s,wm.hash_json(s) from (values('{"schema":1,"id":"systems","variant":"standard","name":"Custom Systems Discovery","service_type":"catalog_project","catalog_version":"2026-10-29-v4-offers","currency":"USD","scope":"Written stakeholder intake and follow-ups for one proposed system, up to three user roles and two integrations. Optional two 60-minute stakeholder appointments. Map the essential user journeys, data inventory, permissions, source systems and one prioritized minimum viable release. Create a clickable low-fidelity prototype linking up to five key-screen wireframes and one focused technical feasibility spike. The spike is exploratory and is not production software. Document acceptance criteria, failure/recovery cases, hosting and third-party dependencies, data retention responsibilities and support ownership. Identify exclusions, unresolved decisions and risks; provide a phased implementation estimate and proposed maintenance arrangement. One consolidated review round and written/recorded handoff of diagrams, wireframes and specification. Optional 60-minute appointment. Client can use deliverables to seek other quotes.","exclusions":["Production build, unlimited feasibility research or a promise that every idea is viable","Compliance certification or handling live sensitive records during discovery","Unbounded autonomous AI, new foundation-model development or a fixed-price portal before its data/permissions are known"],"acceptance":["The first release has named screens, roles, data flows and acceptance tests.","Unknowns and feasibility limits are recorded honestly.","The build estimate separates implementation, external fees and ongoing support.","Discovery files are usable without retaining W&M for the build."],"components":[],"milestones":[{"id":"stage_1","deliverable":"Book the agreed scope","amount_minor":74750,"acceptan